# TypeScript-only repository

All **maintained source** in this repo is **TypeScript** (`.ts`). Do not add hand-written JavaScript (`.js`, `.jsx`, `.mjs`) anywhere except compiled output under `out/` and third-party trees (`node_modules/`, `corpus/`).

| Area | Location | Notes |
|------|----------|--------|
| Extension | `src/**/*.ts` | Bundled to `out/extension.js` via esbuild |
| Repo scripts | `scripts/**/*.ts` | Run with `tsx` (grammar build, WASM fetch, corpus sync, guards) |
| Root tooling | `esbuild.config.ts`, `eslint.config.ts`, `vitest.config.ts` | Included in `tsconfig.tools.json` |

- **Run via:** [tsx](https://github.com/privatenumber/tsx) for scripts and config — no separate compile step for tooling.
- **Enforced by:** `allowJs: false` in both tsconfigs, ESLint `no-restricted-syntax` on forbidden paths under `src/` and `scripts/`, `npm run check:typescript-only` (CI), and `npm run lint`.

When adding new code, use `.ts` and match existing module/style conventions in the repo.
